2. **Fabricated Feature Dimensions:** The manuscript falsely defined the extracted telemetry vector $X_{t}$ as having only 4 dimensions ($M=4$). The `train_model.py` pipeline explicitly builds and trains on a 10-dimensional feature array ($M=10$).

